{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Apple 公佈 iPhone Duo 的預估維修費用，在沒有 AppleCare Plus 的情況下，內螢幕損壞的維修費達 999 美元，香港及台灣則為 HK$8,749/NT$37,350。iPhone Duo 售價由 HK$17,499 /NT$74,900 起，那就是比一台全新的 iPhone 17 還要貴，跟 iPhone 18 Pro 定價 HK$10,499 /NT$44,900 只差少許！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7e891e519b24435127f2a38389e5cbec1e104573f0b2582c9821e9a1cec857cf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fc24c90f8ae844c4feaaa97a47845087d\"/><h3>各項維修預估收費</h3><p>Apple 公佈的收費涵蓋多個項目，最便宜的「表層損壞」收費 HK$399/NT$1,700。內螢幕損壞的維修費高達 HK$8,749/NT$37,350。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5a4be3660f1dc48cbc2382f35b8160df2b541ebd8c897f1585bbcefd52431e69/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F4c7bc24cda58a9aee64e56087178d5ea\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/233d5c21eb80b8dd65e7931d030b04c7634ee668f0297d6add81b2750869c7cd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F458cfc394e4763252ef1f52a27ea6692\"/><h3>宜加購買 AppleCare Plus</h3><p>若用戶購買 AppleCare Plus，收費會明顯下降！更換電池免費，內螢幕維修 HK$788 / NT$3,200 ，其他意外損壞同為 HK$788／NT$3,200。香港區的 iPhone Duo AppleCare+ 費用為 HK$2,599，台灣則有待公佈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.275237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":447,"images":3,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T21:59:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:14.241262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:14.241262+00:00","content_hash":"9ed8969979adc7341f99e8193670a6cc46bb937ac91b1e7d97e16de73b04a6dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}